    },
    {
      "sort": 200000,
      "name": "Hexes are like ...",
      "type": "text",
      "_id": "KtczlVrpoZ44QWt7",
      "system": {},
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "image": {},
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p><em>… things you've seen in games such as Civilization, Sims, Stronghold Crusader, etc.</em></p><ul><li><p>Hexes are property you control, and develop, which provide you with resources to power the rest of the \"Hex Layer\" portion of the game.</p></li><li><p>Different types of settlements provide different types of resources.</p></li><li><p>Developing things in certain ways unlock different sorts of effects and bonuses for your group.</p></li><li><p>Aligning and controlling hexes, developing them into their complete state, is the core remit of the game,</p></li><li><p>The more hexes you control, the more powerful you become.</p></li></ul>"
      },
      "video": {
        "controls": true,
        "volume": 0.5
      },
      "src": null,
      "category": null,
      "ownership": {
        "default": -1,
        "vmUfDuSYUIe7V5uB": 3
      },
      "flags": {},
      "_stats": {
        "compendiumSource": null,
        "duplicateSource": null,
        "exportSource": null,
        "coreVersion": "14.363",
        "systemId": "fourththing",
        "systemVersion": "0.6.0",
        "lastModifiedBy": "bytUGWIOqq9eT7Or",
        "createdTime": 1781116255233,
        "modifiedTime": 1781116255233
      },
      "_key": "!journal.pages!XTqai5nZt42c3r2X.KtczlVrpoZ44QWt7"
    },
    {
      "sort": 300000,
      "name": "OPs are like ...",
      "type": "text",
      "_id": "Ellj9N2ltPDjO9lS",
      "system": {},
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "image": {},
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p><em>… action points, mana points, Clarity points, etc, in other systems. They represent the total power potential of a Faction, and are used across a variety of use cases, including:</em></p><p></p><ul><li><p>Maintaining and developing hexes, (including paying upkeep for things like garrisons)</p></li><li><p>Powering Raid Maneuvers</p></li><li><p>Powering Strategic Actions</p></li><li><p>Powering Travel</p></li><li><p>Buying things</p></li><li><p>Resolving quest activities</p></li><li><p>Setting base bonuses for OP checks</p></li><li><p>Power certain PC level powers</p></li></ul>"
      },
      "video": {
        "controls": true,
        "volume": 0.5
      },
      "src": null,
      "category": null,
      "ownership": {
        "default": -1,
        "vmUfDuSYUIe7V5uB": 3
      },
      "flags": {},
      "_stats": {
        "compendiumSource": null,
        "duplicateSource": null,
        "exportSource": null,
        "coreVersion": "14.363",
        "systemId": "fourththing",
        "systemVersion": "0.6.0",
        "lastModifiedBy": "bytUGWIOqq9eT7Or",
        "createdTime": 1781116255233,
        "modifiedTime": 1781116255233
      },
      "_key": "!journal.pages!XTqai5nZt42c3r2X.Ellj9N2ltPDjO9lS"
    },
    {
      "sort": 400000,
      "name": "Raids are like ...",
      "type": "text",
      "_id": "TsaCClTVF2EcMSF9",
      "system": {},
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "image": {},
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p><em>skirmishes in other games like Warhammer 40k, Rogue Trader, or Battletech.</em></p><p></p><ul><li><p>Not all Raids involve violence. Some involve stealth, or diplomacy, or other contested activities.</p></li><li><p>Not all Raids are Faction v Faction directly. Some are Faction v Rig, Faction v Facility, or Faction vs Raid Boss.</p></li><li><p>But all are, fundamentally, a Faction vs another entity, using opposing OP checks managed through the Raid interface.</p></li></ul>"
      },
      "video": {
        "controls": true,
        "volume": 0.5
      },
      "src": null,
      "category": null,
      "ownership": {
        "default": -1,
        "vmUfDuSYUIe7V5uB": 3
      },
      "flags": {},
      "_stats": {
        "compendiumSource": null,
        "duplicateSource": null,
        "exportSource": null,
        "coreVersion": "14.363",
